{
  "_doc": [
    "Ambient vignettes in the neighbourhoods (src/client/vignettes.ts draws their props and runs their reactions and lines; the",
    "people are the crowd's, src/client/crowd.ts, posed by their act). Draw-only, never in the sim. Each vignette: id (stable: the",
    "story may hang side stories on it), name, area, at (site metres) and heading (compass degrees, 0 north/+y, the way it",
    "faces), near (metres: what counts as near it), members (type: a data/pedestrians.json look; act: what they do, vignettes.ts",
    "ACTS; at [right, ahead] metres from the anchor, face degrees turned from its heading, seat height for a chair, z over the ground",
    "(the rope walker), extra: dropped on",
    "low; path [[right, ahead], ...] and speed for one who walks a line back and forth; circle radius and speed for one who circles",
    "the anchor), props (kind, at, face, z over the ground, length for a rope, text for a sign, held: a sign on a pole), react (what a",
    "moment near it does:",
    "combo, a big combo landed near: look, cheer, film or statue; trick, a trick started near: tip; grind, a grind started near:",
    "flinch; pass, skating through near at speed: look, flinch, film, statue or scatter), sound (a loop played near it: guitar, drums,",
    "boombox), lines (a few spoken lines, on combo, trick, grind or pass; voice in data/voices.json; tools/gen_voices.py makes the",
    "mp3s; captioned). drawDistance: metres from the camera (times the preset's); lineCooldown: seconds before the same vignette",
    "speaks again, globalCooldown: before any vignette speaks again; hear: metres within which a line is said; bigPoints: a combo's",
    "points to count; passSpeed: m/s to count as skating through; soundFar: metres a loop fades out over."
  ],
